        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "只是量產的動力甲而已，博士......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "不會動用太多的力量......別太擔心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "博士，這些與防衛科丟失的自律機甲的編號吻合，但是數量對不上，還差五具。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "繼續找嗎，博士？要在它們還沒出秘密通道前全部解決，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "要是、要是真出現在所有人面前......就算傷不到副總統，也會引起足夠大的騷亂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "辛苦了，迷迭香。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "博士，你怎麼想到利用繆爾賽思的權限先查防衛科的裝備出入庫記錄的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "窮舉法？沒想到一下子就碰到了正確答案。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "刺客應該不會偽裝成研究員向副總統潑腐蝕性溶劑。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "嗯。原來是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有些古怪。這些自律機甲的行動很保守。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "與其說是在準備一場刺殺，更像是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
          "text": "博士，有動靜。"
